    <summary>We completely determine all semigroup varieties satisfiyng a permutational identity of length 3 that are cancellable elements of the lattice of all semigroup varieties. Using this result, we provide a series of new examples of semigroup varieties that are a modular but not cancellable elements of this lattice.</summary>
